260	/**
261	 * Take ownership of one channel's `about` edges: create what is missing and
262	 * re-stamp metadata/source on what already exists.
263	 *
264	 * The metadata is per-channel (it carries `channel_key`), so this is one batch
265	 * per channel rather than one for the whole sync.
